WEBVTT

00:12:00.454 --> 00:12:03.079
Next, he made a list of every
notable person in

00:12:03.079 --> 00:12:08.871
the Phoenix agency ecosystem CEOs, CFOs,
marketing directors, you name it.

00:12:09.579 --> 00:12:12.954
And then he made paid search
ads targeting each of them.

00:12:13.787 --> 00:12:17.787
So let's say you're an executive named
John Smith and you're Googling yourself

00:12:17.787 --> 00:12:22.579
because you have nothing better to do.
You type your name into Google.

00:12:22.579 --> 00:12:25.496
And the very first result
that pops up says,

00:12:25.662 --> 00:12:28.621
hey, John Smith, I'm Dallas McLaughlin.

00:12:29.121 --> 00:12:32.662
I'm a digital marketing expert and I
really want to work for your company.